  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The minimum number of moles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> required for complete combustion of 1 mole of propane and 2 moles of butane is..............",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "18",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(1) Combustion of propane.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mole</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mole</mi></math></p><p>(2) Combustion of butane</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mole</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mole</mi></math></p><p>so total mole of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p>",
